    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Dans le village de Ronenval, tout semble normal. Trop normal pour Th\u00e9o qui ne r\u00eave que d\u2019une chose : \u00e9chapper \u00e0 son destin de boloss. Un jour, il d\u00e9niche \u00e0 la biblioth\u00e8que un livre de magie qui contient les secrets de fabrication d\u2019une bague d\u2019invisibilit\u00e9. Avec l\u2019aide de ses meilleurs amis Bonnav et Laura, il d\u00e9cide de fabriquer cette bague. Surprise : Th\u00e9o dispara\u00eet pour de bon ! Victime de trois m\u00e9chantes sorci\u00e8res, il reste bloqu\u00e9 dans l\u2019invisibilit\u00e9...Il se lance alors dans une course effr\u00e9n\u00e9e contre le temps et contre tous, entra\u00een\u00e9 dans une folle aventure riche d\u2019obstacles et de rencontres. Arkandias, un \u00e9trange individu toujours \u00e0 leurs trousses, est peut-\u00eatre le seul \u00e0 pouvoir les aider.",
        "english": "Everything seems normal in the village of Ronenval. Too normal for Th\u00e9o who dreams of only one thing: to escape his destiny of being an ugly outcast. One day, he discovers a book about magic in the local library. The book contains the secrets for making a ring that renders the wearer invisible. With the help of his best friends Bonnav and Laura, Th\u00e9o decides to make the ring. Surprise: Th\u00e9o disappears completely! The victim of three cruel witches, he stays stuck in an invisible world... He then sets out on a frenzied race against time and against everyone, caught up in a crazy adventure full of obstacles and encounters. Arkandias, a strange individual always on their tail, is perhaps the only person able to help Th\u00e9o and his friends."
